Z||000000||mbramble||10-12-2000||07:57 PM||||Just finished installing my new passenger door with pw/pm/pl.  I had completed the driver's door last Sunday.  Sunroof has been installed and doesn't leak.  And I put on an aero fascia.  This weekend I hope to paint the sunroof [or the fiberglass around the sunroof glass!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">] and front fascia to match the rest of the car.<P>It's like having a new car!!!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by mbramble (edited 10-12-2000).]||||reg||1
