Z||000002||mbramble||10-13-2000||08:13 PM||||I just added a set of courtesy lights in the footwells (this was a very basic coupe!) and a remote trunk opener.  Just had to plug the courtesy light harness to the plug already in my car.  I added a three button dome light unit and it's so cool when you press the center button, the dome lights and courtesy lights come on.  <P>The car has a four wire harness going to the trunk connector, but only three were on the other side that ran into the trunk lid.  The selenoid (sp) unit I got only had a single wire running thru the trunk.  I pulled it into the trunk along with the other three wires that were there and spliced it in on the trunk side of the connector.  The fourth, unused terminal on the car harness was from the trunk relay.  I moved the ajar switch from my original latch to the new latch and plugged it back into the existing 3 wire harness.  The remote switch works and I still have my 'ajar' switch working. <P>I will put in a light for the rear cargo area tomorrow and I think I am finished for awhile -- except for the above mentioned painting.....<P>Also checked, after reading a recent thread, and found my light for the front cargo area.  Put in a bulb, turned on the parking lights and viola, it works too.||||reg||1
